==English==
===Verb===
'''[[have]] a [[frog]] [[in]] one's [[throat]]'''
#{{idiom}} To feel the need to [[cough]]; to have a [[tickle]] in one's throat; to have a scratchy or [[uneven]] [[voice]].
#:''I just woke up and I '''have a frog in my throat'''.  Give me a minute.''

